# DbDataBuild's conformance suite. The quick, apply and templates groups need SQL Server 2022 and PostgreSQL 17; the slow groups and
# the nightly full run add the engines below (`testenv/testenv.sh up mssql postgres mssql2025 oracle spark bigquery flight flight-tls`,
# or `up all`, which also starts the others).
